  "title": "Steakhouse Pecan Pork Chops",
  "description": "These steakhouse pork chops are encrusted in chopped pecans and panko bread crumbs, then pan-fried for an elegant main course with minimal effort.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
